values ('bbbb0005-0000-4000-8000-000000000027', 'en', null, 'Gender Studies', 'An academic introduction to gender studies, the interdisciplinary field that examines how gender shapes individuals, institutions, and societies. You will cover the sex and gender distinction, core concepts such as roles, socialization, patriarchy, and intersectionality, the field''s history and main theories, and how gender appears in work, media, and cultures around the world. Structure and topics adapted from the Gender studies article on Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia (CC BY-SA 4.0).', null, 'foundations', 85, true, 'humanities', '{}')
